{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23444","headline":"酬微之夸镜湖 · 白居易","name":"酬微之夸镜湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我嗟身老岁方徂，君更官高兴转孤。\n军门郡合曾闲否，禹穴耶溪得到无。\n酒盏省陪波卷白，骰盘思共彩呼卢。\n一泓镜水谁能羡，自有胷中万顷湖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23444.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23444","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}